{"3207080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Keplerian Space Discovery", "steam_appid": 3207080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207080/extras/8d2ce1d1e7054586541dc51aa5003bc3.avif?t=1785800285\" width=1240 height=1754 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207080/extras/616641c6720c215eebe8198a89b229a0.avif?t=1785800285\" width=1280 height=720 /></span>Keplerian Space Discovery is a realistic spaceship trajectory simulator game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Our solar system</strong> is built to scale and rendered with lifelike graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Furthermore</strong>, the motion of each celestial body is precisely simulated using <strong>Kepler's laws</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Players can construct</strong> their own rocket by assembling various components.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fly Me to the Moon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, let's go to the moon, the moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's one big step for us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No rabbits.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207080/extras/d886984258af36e6c6090353ec0b4354.avif?t=1785800285\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Video Policy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game can be streamed or have videos posted without prior permission, whether you are an individual or a company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no restrictions on monetization or which parts of the game you can showcase.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span cla